// Mage Arena II champions (arena-rematch design, chosen by Corey). The real MA2 bosses
// (Justiciar Zachariah, Derwen, Porazdir) have no models in this cache, so the three gods' own
// battle mages return as champions: same models, much stronger. Spawned one after another in
// Kolodion's arena by areas/area_mage_arena/scripts/mage_arena_2.rs2 - never placed on the map.

